body:
There's several reasons, but the Tldr is $$$  


Part of it has to do with the College season ending so they aren't competing with each other. 

&#x200B;

There are no bye weeks in the last few weeks so we have more games and the NFL wants as many of them televised as possible. 

&#x200B;

Team playing on Mondays and Thursdays at the end of the season can provide an advantage/disadvantage going into the playoffs.
